    "id": 3,
    "topic": "Flagship Pioneering's Academic Model",
    "content_sourced": "<a href='https://www.flagshippioneering.com/'>Flagship Pioneering</a>, which created Moderna, has a unique model: they don't wait for academics to start companies. Founded by <a href='https://www.flagshippioneering.com/people/noubar-afeyan'>Noubar Afeyan</a>, they identify promising academic research, create companies around it, and install professional management. Founded <a href='https://www.flagshippioneering.com/companies'>40+ companies</a> with $30B+ in aggregate value.",
    "sources": [
      {"name": "Flagship Pioneering", "url": "https://www.flagshippioneering.com/", "type": "corporate"},
      {"name": "Noubar Afeyan Bio", "url": "https://www.flagshippioneering.com/people/noubar-afeyan", "type": "corporate"},
      {"name": "Flagship Companies", "url": "https://www.flagshippioneering.com/companies", "type": "corporate"}
    ],
    "significance": "major"
  },
